{"availability":"available","full":"CalmRay-Solutions/uptime-guard","name":"uptime-guard","description":"Self-hosted uptime, TCP, DNS, TLS-cert, domain & heartbeat monitoring on Cloudflare Workers - with escalating Telegram + Web Push alerts, SLA/incident history, and public status pages. Runs free.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":34,"forks":11,"created":"2026-08-03T10:01:39Z","updated":"2026-09-25T13:00:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vigil-demo.calmray.team","topics":["cloudflare-d1","cloudflare-workers","devops","monitoring","pwa","react","self-hosted","serverless","status-page","telegram-bot","typescript","uptime","uptime-monitoring","web-push"],"demo":"https://vigil-demo.calmray.team/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:34:46.561Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:34:46.561Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:34:46.561Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:15.139Z","stars":29,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:02.290Z","stars":31,"forks":11},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:30.937Z","stars":31,"forks":11},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:34:46.561Z","stars":34,"forks":11}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Uptime monitoring with zero servers. Runs 100% on Cloudflare. Free.","Monitor your websites, APIs, TCP ports, DNS, TLS certificates, domains, cron jobs and multi-step scripted flows - no VPS, no container, no monthly bill. Just a Cloudflare Worker, a database, and a dashboard.","Every other uptime tool makes you choose: pay per monitor (UptimeRobot, Pingdom, Better Uptime) or host it on a server you then have to monitor too (Uptime Kuma on a VPS). Uptime Guard is neither. It runs entirely on Cloudflare Workers + D1, so there's nothing to keep alive and, for a typical fleet, nothing to pay."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CalmRay-Solutions/uptime-guard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"40e7c632d3df5d7e6f6df73ddf694fbc8cf145283118a427a199